{"timestamp": 1779340001.6797905, "event_type": "body_reported", "tick": 11, "data": {"caller": "player_5", "reason": "Frank reported a dead body", "bodies": [{"room": "security", "victim_name": "Charlie"}]}}
{"timestamp": 1779340001.6801438, "event_type": "phase_changed", "tick": 11, "data": {"phase": "discussion"}}
{"timestamp": 1779340010.0819883, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "I found Charlie dead in security. My route was cafeteria, down to medbay, across to electrical, and then into security where the body was. I didn't run into a single person on my entire route, so the killer must have vented or gone towards weapons or navigation. If anyone was near those rooms, let us know who you saw."}}
{"timestamp": 1779340049.8089225, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "I started my tasks in Oxygen, then moved down through the Cafeteria, into Medbay, and I'm currently in Electrical. \n\nFrank, I find your route a bit questionable. You just claimed you went through Medbay and Electrical right before finding the body in Security, and that you didn't see a single person. But Alice and I are in Electrical right now. Unless our timing was perfectly staggered so we narrowly missed each other in the hallways, you should have seen at least one of us. \n\nAlice, you can back me up that we're both in Electrical. I'm not going to hard accuse Frank just yet since timing can be tricky, but his story definitely has a hole in it. Let's listen to what the others have to say, especially anyone near Nav or Weapons like Frank suggested."}}
{"timestamp": 1779340066.66737, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "Bob is absolutely right. I can confirm we are both in Electrical right now\u2014he walked in from Medbay near the very end of the round. \n\nFrank, your route makes absolutely no sense. If you went from Medbay through Electrical to Security, you had to have crossed paths with me, Bob, or someone else. Which brings me to my most important information:\n\nI was in Security from tick 6 to tick 8. Charlie was alive and well. But he wasn't alone\u2014Diana was in there with him. She walked into Security from Electrical at tick 6 and was still standing there with Charlie when I left to go to Electrical. Eve was also nearby earlier (I saw her leave Security towards Weapons around tick 4).\n\nDiana, you have a lot of explaining to do. You were literally in the room with Charlie right before he died. What happened after I left? Did you see Frank come in? \n\nRight now, my top two suspects are Diana (for being the last one seen with the victim) and Frank (for claiming a route where he somehow ghosted past all of us). Let's hear what Diana and Eve have to say before we vote."}}
{"timestamp": 1779340079.8568034, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "Alice is spot on about my movements early in the round. I started in Security, left around tick 4 to head up to Weapons, and then moved to the Cafeteria where I am now. I didn't run into anyone else along my route.\n\nSince I was long gone by the time Alice, Charlie, and Diana were in Security, I can't shed any light on the murder itself. However, Alice's timeline corroborates my own, which makes her trustworthy in my eyes. \n\nThis leaves us with two major suspects: Diana and Frank. Frank's claim that he walked through Medbay and Electrical without seeing anyone is extremely hard to believe when we have two players (Alice and Bob) confirming they were exactly there. Diana, you're up next. You need to explain what happened in Security after Alice left. If you can clear your name, Frank's \"ghost\" route looks like a blatant Duck lie to cover up a kill. \n\nLet's listen to Diana carefully. I'm leaning toward Frank right now because of the geographical impossibility of his route, but I'll hold my vote until Diana speaks."}}
{"timestamp": 1779340093.2496994, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "Alice, your timeline is 100% accurate. I was indeed in Security with you and Charlie. After you left for Electrical at tick 8, I stayed for exactly one more tick before heading up north to Weapons to clear asteroids. Charlie was perfectly alive and well when I walked out.\n\nFrank, your story is completely falling apart. If Bob and Alice were in Electrical, and I was moving from Security up to Weapons, there is zero chance you walked through Medbay and Electrical into Security without seeing a single soul. You are lying about your route.\n\nHere's what I think really happened: Frank came up from Navigation or vented into Security right after I left, killed Charlie, and then self-reported to control the narrative and frame me since I was the last one seen with him. Thanks to Alice and Bob confirming their positions, we know Frank's path is a geographical impossibility. He's a Duck caught in a lie. I'm voting Frank."}}
{"timestamp": 1779340111.9152596, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "Listen everyone, I know how bad it looks, but I am telling the absolute truth! I genuinely did not see anyone on my route. The vision range is limited, and the timing must have perfectly aligned so that I missed Bob and Alice while passing through Electrical. \n\nThink about what Diana just admitted: she was the last person in Security with Charlie right up until tick 9. I walked in shortly after and he was dead. She had the perfect opportunity to kill him right before she left for Weapons, and now she is using my lack of sightings to frame me and save herself. She's a Duck trying to control the narrative. I am voting for Diana, and I urge you all to see through her lie!"}}
